Package: provisionr
Title: Sparse Text Classification Workflows for Contract Provisions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Todd", "Grabowsky", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "todd@example.com")
Description: Reusable building blocks for classifying short legal texts such as
    contract provisions: data access for the LEDGAR corpus (LexGLUE), text
    normalisation and duplicate detection, leakage-safe sparse TF-IDF feature
    builders, a small uniform interface over fast linear and Bayesian
    classifiers, and evaluation helpers (stratified and grouped k-fold
    cross-validation, target shuffling, bootstrap confidence intervals) with
    matching 'ggplot2' visualisations.
